{"abstract":"Den gaveøkonomi, som vi byggede vores velfærdssamfund op på, er i dag stort set fortrængt af pengeøkonomisk styring. Det er dumt og kortsigtet - gaveøkonomien har et enormt potentiale, som vi får brug for efter covid-19.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Thygesen, Niels Thyge","Løfvall, Steffen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-284776"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"gaveøkonomi er vejen til at få velfærden tilbage","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://politiken.dk/debat/kroniken/art8062780/Der-findes-to-%C3%B8konomier-og-den-sidste-f%C3%A5r-vi-brug-for-efter-covid-19","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-284776","ids":["cbs-62074ef2-1550-49dd-8d83-14e726e03074"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-9B2E77741604541AB3A5ED34AE0DDECC"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Management, Politics and Philosophy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["cph:learning"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Niels Thyge","k