{"abstract":"Vores velfærd står og falder med, at vi finder nye innovative måder at organisere os på. Såkaldt ’gaveøkonomi’ er en af dem, og den målelige værdi baner allerede vejen til mere og bedre velfærd.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Thygesen, Niels Thyge","Løfvall, Steffen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-298835"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"gaveøkonomi giver mere velfærd for pengene","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"djc","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.mm.dk/artikel/velfaerdsforskere-gaveoekonomi-giver-mere-velfaerd-for-pengene","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-298835","ids":["cbs-f54a3f57-789d-48fd-a7d8-c6d81f1e01af"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-2EE0DC008392616FFA11BFF813E79D0D"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Management, Politics and Philosophy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Niels Thyge","key":"thygesenpau","last":"Thygesen","locid":"33ad1a89-2b7c-4f25-81b6-8971b98ed8ff","name":"Thygesen, Niels Thyge","orcid":"0000-0003-2516-2973","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Steffen","key":"løfvallpau","last":"Løfvall","name":"Løfvall, Steffen","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["22456058"],"issue":"31","journal":"Mandag Morgen","pages":"24-25","publisher":"Ma